      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Checks before execution",
      "items": [
        "The HTTP gateway verifies user status and the Core\u2013Knowledge pairing.",
        "Access rechecks the user, resource ACL and active team membership."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Session lifecycle",
      "items": [
        "Unused failed workers are evicted; lost sessions return 404.",
